  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "塩味が　ある　食材。茹でた麺。　サンドウィッチの具材として　可能性は　未知数。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "짠맛이 나는 식재료. 삶은 면이다. 샌드위치 재료로서의 가능성은 미지수다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "帶有鹹味的食材。煮熟的麵條。以三明治的材料而言，其可能性仍未可知。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un ingrédient au goût salé. Ces nouilles bouillies offrent au Sandwich auquel on les ajoute des possibilités gustatives infinies.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Eine salzige Zutat. Mit der Verwendung von gekochten Nudeln als Sandwichbelag betritt man in kulinarischer Hinsicht absolutes Neuland.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "El sabor sencillo y salado de los fideos hervidos abre la puerta a una infinidad de posibilidades como relleno de bocadillo hasta ahora desconocidas.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un ingrediente salato. Le possibilità offerte come companatico da questi tagliolini bolliti non sono ancora state esplorate a fondo.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A nice salty ingredient. It’s unclear how well these boiled noodles will serve as a sandwich filling.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
